#
# This file contains custom keybindings for Nushell.
# The main keybindings are defined in config.nu, but you can add additional
# custom bindings here.

# Example: Add custom keybindings to the existing config
# Note: Keybindings are typically set in config.nu, but this file can be used
# for additional custom bindings if needed.

# To add keybindings, you would modify the $env.config.keybindings in config.nu
# or define custom commands that are triggered by existing keybindings.
